{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0503_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "a8501f1c2f7955116b57f9464cfd0f362b45dab11e25a62110510c42dcb8fef2", "ja": "ババ抜きの、特訓……。\n美也さんに、リベンジ……する……。", "zh": "抽鬼牌的特训……\n要向美也小姐……复仇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0503_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ce26f082db00606a8af1996b83b6991900c6525cbe135cb7b02088a73c333e6b", "ja": "リベンジ……。\n美也はババ抜きが強いのか？", "zh": "复仇……  \n美也很擅长抽鬼牌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0503_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "4767d6270773fad5a16c83b0bed86a396bf49f1b654ddfc307101ab94ad967e5", "ja": "……ラスボスかと、思った……。\nでも……準備なしで挑んだ、杏奈が悪い……です。", "zh": "……还以为是……最终Boss呢……\n不过……没做准备就去挑战的杏奈……也有错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0503_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "50ad5cdf995b8ca7f69dc5bcf4ebc0deef6f2cd64c9df545be2b588af82e2ebd", "ja": "引っ掛けも、心理戦も……通らない……。\n杏奈、ジョーカーばっかり……。", "zh": "陷阱和心理战……全都不管用……\n杏奈手上，净是鬼牌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0503_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "44be92c5a086e9dbdb838239b0769aac93eba4b42fb40ffc3c014ab439ecd3d6", "ja": "美也さん、本物のなるちゃんみたいで……\n杏奈、びっくりした……かも。", "zh": "美也姐好像真的就是小鸣……杏奈有点吃惊……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0503_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f9230214abda53f7e6efaa390f3fbd671aa281e6a036acd5986ae8b543c476f0", "ja": "美也となるの、意外な共通点だな。\nそれで、特訓？", "zh": "这是美也和鸣之间意外的共同点啊。然后，是特训吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0503_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "10ab2e092306afb25ae19f37c09c8fcc1dfd1486698da48aa830ff79453a13b1", "ja": "ん……。真珠星ちゃんみたいに……\nコツコツ、やらないと……。", "zh": "嗯……必须要像真珠星那样……\n脚踏实地、一步一步来才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0503_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ff8c5c4e4dbdacb17783412e40fed4518c6784335df7a9823b183acce8c20f6b", "ja": "そうか。でも、練習相手が俺でいいのか？\n全然強くないと思うけど……。", "zh": "这样啊。不过，拿我当练习对手真的没问题吗？\n我觉得自己完全不强……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0503_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "9249713ea4f708fa42eadaf935a405d5002ffde6299147e76b64f9690d3df112", "ja": "レベル、違いすぎると……\n特訓にならない、から……。", "zh": "如果等级差距太大……就没法起到特训的作用……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0503_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ded437261b96abe89243e6db2d6b887c34d576c16745060cf08e30e3e546ce5f", "ja": "確かに。そこそこのレベルの相手と戦って、\n勝ってモチベーションを上げるのも大事だな。", "zh": "说得也是。和水平相当的对手切磋，\n赢了之后提升斗志，这一点也很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0503_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "cb50f1f1bf47e6a9af23f5aee22e6351f381142caa143f26ab295cbd45a7b7f9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n杏奈に、協力してくれる……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n愿意帮助杏奈……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0503_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f9e6dbdbca6df1da07d0326e5d692ac34d4368d8db2422cf4b152a9fb5f034fd", "ja": "もちろん！　現実逃避……じゃなくて、\nちょうど休憩しようと思ってたところだしな。", "zh": "当然！逃避现实……才不是呢，\n我刚好也正想着休息一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
