{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0503_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "d9044acf2681a9394b668e8f3001b40439190409c00adee58d5e4ce3441f0ab9", "ja": "やること、いっぱいだけど……\n杏奈、がんばります……！", "zh": "要做的事情还有很多……\n杏奈会加油的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
